                                                <p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
												Dear Support and Customer Care team,
												</p>
                                                <p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
												Below are the details of any changes in Materials status/Customer accounts/Addresses that have been detected during periodic data load updates.
												</p>
                                                <p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
                                                        #if(${ctx.materialPushCount} > 0)
                                                            <b>Total number of Products updated in eCommerce : ${ctx.materialPushCount} </b>
                                                        #else
                                                            <b>No Products are updated in eCommerce </b>
                                                        #end
												</p>
												<p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
                                                        #if(${ctx.customerPushCount} > 0)
                                                            <b>Total number of Customers updated in eCommerce : $ctx.customerPushCount </b>
                                                        #else
                                                            <b>No Customers are updated in eCommerce </b>
                                                        #end
												</p>
												<p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
                                                        #if(${ctx.addressPushCount} > 0)
                                                            <b>Total number of Addresses updated in eCommerce : $ctx.addressPushCount </b>
                                                        #else
                                                            <b>No Addresses are updated in eCommerce </b>
                                                        #end
												</p>
												<p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
                                                        #if(${ctx.pricePushCount} > 0)
                                                            <b>Total number of Prices updated in eCommerce : $ctx.pricePushCount </b>
                                                        #else
                                                            <b>No Prices are updated in eCommerce </b>
                                                        #end
                                                </p>

												<p class="text p" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 20px; color: #05322b; font-family: 'Poppins','Lucida Sans'; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;">
                                                        #if(${ctx.getAttachmentAvailable()})
                                                            <b>Attached to this email please find a detailed report for your convenience.</b>
                                                        #end
												</p>

											</td>
                                        </tr>
										#if(${ctx.materialPushDataList})
											<tr>
